   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "Organism is Synechococcus sp. PCC 7002 (strain TK.032); photoautotrophic, aerobic (air + 5% CO2 sparge, photosynthetic O2), so oxygen corrected from 'facultative' to 'aerobic'. Standard Medium A+ has NO ammonium: the sole N sources are nitrate (Medium A base NaNO3 plus the paper's 110 mM NaNO3 supplement), so the current EX_nh4_e/'Ammonium' entry is spurious and should be dropped. The current mapping of 'CO2 (5% CO2 gas sparge)' to EX_cobalt2_e is a mis-map: CO2 is the carbon source (map to EX_co2_e) and cobalt is a separate genuine trace element from CoCl2 in the P1 mix. Base salt/trace conce"
  },
